  :question/problem "**(c)(i)** For $\\mathbf F=\\left\\langle\\frac{-y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}},\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\\right\\rangle$, find its domain.\n\nDomain: {{answer}}."
  :question/answer-fields ["8b628751-9b0a-5e3a-8424-44e093fc265c"]
  :question/worked-solution "The denominator vanishes exactly at $(0,0)$. Exclude the origin; the field is smooth everywhere else."
