 {:db/id "33bdc090-a755-588f-843a-154b39670898"
  :answer/id #uuid "33bdc090-a755-588f-843a-154b39670898"
  :answer/type :answer.type/text
  :answer/value "By multiplicativity,\n\n$$\\det(A)=\\det(P^{-1}BP)=\\det(P^{-1})\\det(B)\\det(P)\n=\\frac{1}{\\det(P)}\\det(B)\\det(P)=\\det(B).$$\n\nThe cancellation is valid because $P$ is invertible, so $\\det(P)\\ne0$."
  :db/ensure :answer/validate}
